---
description: Magento custom module vendor must be Megazend for new code
globs: app/code/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

# Magento custom vendor

- **New** custom modules MUST use vendor `Megazend`:
  - Path: `app/code/Megazend/<Module>/`
  - Module name: `Megazend_<Module>`
  - PHP namespace: `Megazend\<Module>\...`
- Do **not** create new `Gogo_*` modules.
- Keep `Gogo_*` only when editing an existing Gogo module under `app/code/Gogo/`.
